{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Purr\u00a0Plate</i></strong>\u00a0\u2013 Craft Your Wholesome Feline Picnic Paradise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Come and build your dream <i>Purr Plate</i>!</strong><br>In this sunlit feline paradise, become the owner of a one-of-a-kind restaurant designed with your dream &quot;Purr Plate&quot;! Team up with over 100+ quirky cat staffers--from paw-kneading bakers to servers tumbling adorably over their own tails--to create your purrfect woodland caf\u00e9!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676490/extras/47c450a1269732c371138b322dfff83d.avif?t=1770344559\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676490/extras_big/47c450a1269732c371138b322dfff83d.avif?t=1770344559 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft Your Whimsical Haven</strong><br>Start from scratch using 50+ modular components:<br>\ud83d\udc3e Combine rustic log kitchens with floating cloud-shaped dining platforms<br>\ud83d\udc3e Design enchanted garden nooks where fireflies illuminate heart-shaped scones<br>\ud83d\udc3e Build nap stations with dangling yarn balls for tired paws<br>Every moss-covered stone and mismatched teacup tells your unique story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Staff with Character</strong><br>Meet your unforgettable team:<br>\u2022\u00a0<strong>Grain</strong>\u00a0\u2013 The chubby tabby who bakes at lightning speed...when not napping in flour sacks<br>\u2022\u00a0<strong>Spring</strong>\u00a0\u2013 A hyperactive kitten delivering orders in 3 seconds flat (and breaking 2 plates)<br>\u2022\u00a0<strong>Scar</strong>\u00a0\u2013 The rugged explorer who hunts rare mushroom ingredients between shifts<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676490/extras/d0a3d30bb129c2ad690116381b7996fe.poster.avif?t=1770344559\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676490/extras/d0a3d30bb129c2ad690116381b7996fe.webm?t=1770344559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676490/extras/d0a3d30bb129c2ad690116381b7996fe.mp4?t=1770344559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stress-Free Strategy</strong><br>Ditch spreadsheets! Our &quot;Claw-culus&quot; system lets you:<br>\u2713 Rotate seasonal menus by catching falling cherry blossoms<br>\u2713 Boost tips by assigning vocal cats to sing for customers<br>\u2713 Design obstacle courses to optimize serving routes<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676490/extras/f12b71a5765fc873d4a5a8fb83e75562.poster.avif?t=1770344559\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676490/extras/f12b71a5765fc873d4a5a8fb83e75562.webm?t=1770344559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676490/extras/f12b71a5765fc873d4a5a8fb83e75562.mp4?t=1770344559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forest of Whiskered Wonders</strong><br>Send adventuring parties beyond the tea fields to:<br>\u2022 Decode recipes from a poetry-reciting owl<br>\u2022 Trade fish cookies with underground mole merchants<br>\u2022 Uncover why the river flows with lavender honey at midnight...<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676490/extras/f777263929e75c12b830c0daa954157e.poster.avif?t=1770344559\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676490/extras/f777263929e75c12b830c0daa954157e.webm?t=1770344559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676490/extras/f777263929e75c12b830c0daa954157e.mp4?t=1770344559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breaking News!</strong><br>Our first playable Demo will arrive soon!<br>Join our playtest event \u2013 let's build <strong><i>Purr Plate</i></strong> together!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Paw Print!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3676490/d041dbd9c00a14ee79648a61ee0663c475164c2f.jpg"},{"name":"kitten can't wait!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3676490/79782b36bfa13b3ffda02edf79cfe1d99b1086b4.jpg"},{"name":"Good Kitty!!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3676490/89cb7e69117d9601aec88756fbdd8c12bbc94f07.jpg"},{"name":"Mad Cat Misses You!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3676490/72333feb7e08eb4b8155d991350dd97976762d52.jpg"},{"name":"Peek into Mystery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3676490/7c04724f6fcefd15bae4d35b13cc4fd3ced37ba6.jpg"},{"name":" Well, Well, What Do We Have Here?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3676490/71902e04bdddecbf1855a8ed30549dcbb528b08d.jpg"},{"name":"Wow! So Generous!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3676490/644c8ad5578421b4ff3ce10515c50c40e65ae167.jpg"},{"name":"Ta-da! Consolation Prize!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3676490/7b9ab7e355c17818b0c3971586b29522edf83647.jpg"},{"name":"This... is for me?!","path":