ass=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676490/extras/f12b71a5765fc873d4a5a8fb83e75562.poster.avif?t=1770344559\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676490/extras/f12b71a5765fc873d4a5a8fb83e75562.webm?t=1770344559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676490/extras/f12b71a5765fc873d4a5a8fb83e75562.mp4?t=1770344559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forest of Whiskered Wonders</strong><br>Send adventuring parties beyond the tea fields to:<br>\u2022 Decode recipes from a poetry-reciting owl<br>\u2022 Trade fish cookies with underground mole merchants<br>\u2022 Uncover why the river flows with lavender honey at midnight...<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676490/extras/f777263929e75c12b830c0daa954157e.poster.avif?t=1770344559\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676490/extras/f777263929e75c12b830c0daa954157e.webm?t=1770344559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676490/extras/f777263929e75c12b830c0daa954157e.mp4?t=1770344559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breaking News!</strong><br>Our first playable Demo will arrive soon!<br>Join our playtest event \u2013 let's build <strong><i>Purr Plate</i></strong> together!</p>","developers":["LeankomGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676490/